/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T17:48:17Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T17:48:17Z","body":"From my point of view, the silhouette of shapes looks the same, so a single CubeMesh is being drawn/constructed differently between MeshInstance3D and CSG... is 3D correct?\n\nI see you want them to be the same.\n\n1. The CubeMesh inside of the MeshInstance3D and CSGBox3D will have different uv coordinates https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95834\n2. Need to check that CubeMesh inside of the CSGMesh3D is closer to expectation\n\nWhat is the original problem? Please explain why two different mesh rendering nodes would have the same indices. Are you trying to do mesh painting?\n\nI would expect mesh lods and such to interfere, too.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2619681730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2620346386","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102113#issuecomment-2620346386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102113","id":2620346386,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cL1AS","user":{"login":"tmilker","id":98860,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4ODYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmilker","html_url":"https://github.com/tmilker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmilker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmilker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmilker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmilker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_