","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-29T08:21:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-29T08:21:22Z","body":"Yes, Manifold removes extra triangles from coplanar faces. There are several ways to make them stay - probably the easiest is adding any kind of extra vertex property. I'm not sure exactly how it's all plumbed through Godot, but it should be doable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2620965728/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2621071000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102113#issuecomment-2621071000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102113","id":2621071000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cOl6Y","user":{"login":"donn-xx","id":392218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjIxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/392218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx","html_url":"https://github.com/donn-xx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/received_events","type":"User"